  ■ codex 

 What starts codex?
 The installer and the executor use this program even when
 it is not on their PATH.

 ❯ 1. ~/.codex/packages/standalone/current/bin/codex
      Found outside PATH; the link is kept so codex updates
      reach the panel.
   2. Type a path.

 Enter to select · ↑/↓ to navigate · Esc to go back
